@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
actor Ambulancier
actor "Coordinateur hospitalier" as Coo
participant Gateway
participant "MS4 Intervention" as MS4
participant "MS5 Hospital" as MS5
queue RabbitMQ
Ambulancier -> Gateway : POST /api/intervention/missions/{id}/transfert
Gateway -> MS4
MS4 -> MS5 : POST /api/hospital/transferts {missionId, specialite} (sync)
MS5 --> MS4 : 201 DEMANDE
Coo -> Gateway : PATCH /api/hospital/transferts/{id}/accepter
Gateway -> MS5
MS5 -> MS5 : réserver une place (placesDisponibles - 1)
MS5 --> RabbitMQ : transfert.confirme (async)
RabbitMQ --> MS4 : met à jour la mission
@enduml
